message: "If you use the iCoder Eval Harness, please cite this repository."
title: "iCoder Eval Harness: Task-Native Evaluation for Industrial Coding Models"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bingreeky/iCoder"
abstract: >-
  A resource-aware evaluation harness for industrial coding models across RTL
  design and GPU kernel optimization. It combines endpoint-neutral candidate
  generation with task-native executable verification and auditable run
  artifacts, supporting local vLLM deployments and external OpenAI-compatible
  APIs.
